  <item>
    <title>Vol.16 堂吉诃德式追梦，是荣耀还是特权 - 2024漫游指南1</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67332bcd43dc3a438709ba76</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67332bcd43dc3a438709ba76</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 12 Nov 2024 10:49:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<h2><strong><span>中文版音乐剧《我，堂吉诃德》 安利漫谈Timeline：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="188">03:08</a> 文化贫瘠多读书，怎么音乐剧老是改编小学课外读物</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="360">06:00</a> 也不是很韦伯，也不是很百老汇的音乐剧如何利用讨喜迪士尼式配角力挽狂澜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="483">08:03</a> 西班牙的文艺作品都哪去了？Recall道长揭秘现代文明第一部小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="551">09:11</a>悬疑剧怎么占据了流媒体西语大头，西语作品不趁Chick-Flick</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="730">12:10</a> 巴萨之旅Call-back：西班牙很大 加泰罗尼亚又是另一个独立之都</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a>西班牙爱情之征服与对抗，西班牙各地区鄙视链也挺好笑的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 法语音乐剧也得美化安达卢西亚的热烈浪漫（内心OS上海哪趁森林啊？）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1218">20:18</a> 十年前七幕人生汉化音乐剧《Q大道》观剧体验：上海人逗咳嗽原来是这样</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>2024 堂吉诃德式发疯旅行总结：</span></strong></h2><span></span><blockquote><span>黛西女士：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 潜水考证：四天三证忙与盲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1560">26:00</a> 下降流：你就是一个孤独的夜哨</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 潜伴制度：走慢一点点你就没氧啦😜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 潜水复盘：走过一回一辈子不会忘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> 水下世界：在诺大的宇宙 在渺小的星球</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>Hilary：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2234">37:14</a> A Long Time Ago, 美西圆梦之旅之自由驰骋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a> Just A Ride, J人也可以不用做任何提前安排</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2650">44:10</a> Orange Sky, 当下的风景和生活感受欣赏留下</span></p><span></span><h2><br></h2><span></span><h2><strong><span>2024 演出Highlight：</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2822">47:02</a> 音乐剧复排得奖满堂彩是不是也是一种ZZZQ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2918">48:38</a> 我们滚青对拉普忍耐天花板：呆英后朋，骂街都得是Brit local</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3055">50:55</a> 法语音乐剧的饭圈化：杀杀我服</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a> 德奥音乐剧主题也经典：我只属于我自己</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>本期BGM彩蛋：</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>《我，堂吉诃德》选段</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1">00:01</a> Opening Theme：骑士归来，吉他开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> Man of La Mancha：My Destiny calls and I go</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a> I Really Like Him：桑丘力挽狂澜 让我喜欢了堂吉诃德很多</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>衍生BGM</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="576">09:36</a> Jueves - La Oreja de Van Gogh 据说西语流行情歌，来着西语朋友推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="897">14:57</a> Rumbo al Norte - 西班牙情事OST：真的很好笑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1049">17:29</a> Changer - 选自法语音乐剧《唐璜》，情情爱爱从上海的森林？到爱尔兰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> Everyone‘s a little bit Racist - 选自音乐剧《Avenue Q》 ，逗咳嗽之歌</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>潜水（海边）BGM</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1418">23:38</a> 教练：孤独的夜哨 - 张震岳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> 潜伴：走慢一点点 - 张震岳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a> 自己：我家门前有大海 - 张震岳</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2114">35:14</a> 海下：无名的情歌 - 张震岳</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>美西BGM（橘子郡男孩OST）</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2268">37:48</a> We Use to be Friends - The Dandy Warhols：那些青春的回忆主题曲响起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2466">41:06</a> Just A Ride - Jem：自驾的自由恐怕就是 just a ride吧，no need to run or no need to hide</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2670">44:30</a> Orange Sky - Alexi Murdoch：欣赏当下的风景和生活就如stood beneath the Orange Sky</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><strong><span>演出总结BGM</span></strong></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2340">39:00</a> The Overload - Yard Act：Mercury 2022提名英伦后朋的英音骂街拉普</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3049">50:49</a> L'assassymphonie (杀杀服你） - 选自法语音乐剧《摇滚莫扎特》：音乐剧饭圈我服我服 不用服我</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3129">52:09</a> Ich gehöre nur mir (我只属于我自己) - 选自德语音乐剧《伊丽莎白》：今年的总结感受是 我不要你再来审判我 我只属于我自己</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本次节目录制特别呈现：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>“如果生活本身已经是这么荒谬，</span></p><span></span><p><span>那么谁能知道什么才是疯狂呢?”</span></p><span></span><p><span>这正如当代年轻人一样持续</span></p><span></span><p><span>做着不可能的梦保持真诚，</span></p><span></span><p><span>乐于追寻乐于奔跑</span></p><span></span><p><span>#音乐剧《我，堂吉诃德》中文版十周年封箱</span></p><span></span><p><span>🗓10月25日-11月17日</span></p><span></span><p><span>📍北京·二七剧院</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>小程序二维码选座下单：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fus_Qx45zyOh1_v2LGu0Tad9AdsK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fnr3eJAVyrIc7cXFOSvsHEDvE7II.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fimo3Lg5Om-z_VwjO2hrYXmruNHb.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lqNApEDvgX-Ks0Xs6co9TrMQ9mCo.m4a" length="61574404" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:56:14</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFSEM2_D3naw1EBKno4wLTzNYum.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
