  <item>
    <title>Vol.13 漫谈芭比 女性主义 周末玩具</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64fb382f3fa4090b7486bcab</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64fb382f3fa4090b7486bcab</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 08 Sep 2023 15:05:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是芭乐人间指北。一档跨时区跨地区书影音文艺评论，交流，对话书影音文艺小指南（京城文艺小指南）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历了放开后的休整，和种种原因，最终决定重新开始录制芭乐人间指北，给各位忠实听众道歉！大家久等了！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期经历了近两月的前中后吃策划录制后期，主要探讨了关于观看芭比的体验感受以及围绕它浅谈了一把女性主义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Daisy：小时候拥有过barbie barbie，影片上映前就期待barbie的barbie( 我也给barbie做过衣服…)</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CICI：茜茜，小时候拥有过barbie barbie，初中还在同学家给barbie做衣服的barbie</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Meng：曾经的顶流，从未拥有过正版Barbie但有数个山寨以及Barbie的英国孪生姐妹Sindy的Barbie。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期播客主题：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="15">00:15</a> 周末艺术家：一个人一个岛屿，怎样连成陆地：当然靠芭比啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="320">05:20</a> highlight关于脚踩缝纫机和红领巾更红了</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>当下观后感受：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="349">05:49</a> 后女性主义的温和回击</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>前期宣发：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="778">12:58</a> 芭比的社交属性，LGBT的狂欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="965">16:05</a> 关于那些芭比粉的死亡记忆</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1041">17:21</a> 中途离场到底是不是宣传手段</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>同时间段影视比较：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1067">17:47</a> 东亚黄昏恋只配给观众道歉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> 油男和丑男都不值得留恋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 联合营销的一些典范（奥本海默+芭比 = ？）</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>电影情节（剧透慎入）：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> Top2哭点:</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Cici老师：成为女性成为人类根本不需要获得别人的批准。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daisy老师：真实的生活世界，呼吸都令人觉得美丽。女性主义是一种温和的团结的可能。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> Top2笑点:</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Meng老师：It‘s All About Ken</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cici老师：典男语录的应用层教育</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daisy老师：父权制度下受压迫的员工是最感同身受的讽刺</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2725">45:25</a> Top最喜欢名场面：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>母女关系：爱与痛的边缘，藏着并不等于遗忘</span></p><span></span><p><span>一些复刻经典电影2001太空漫游的震撼开场</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3230">53:50</a> 不太喜欢的地方：</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3673">61:13</a> 关于结尾的理解：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span>Meng：疼痛难免，选择接受。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daisy：无论是否女权，值得被尊重，平视。</span></p><span></span><p><span>Cici：女性困境的开始，真实世界的疼痛和压力，需要被感受。</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>女性主义的作品和形象推荐：</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4233">70:33</a> Cici：TVB职业女性；《那不勒斯四部曲》（和Daisy老师的Aha moment）《成长教育》《牛仔裤的夏天》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Daisy: 牛仔裤姐妹夏天也是我的最爱之一；傲骨之战；伦敦生活；托斯卡纳艳阳下。</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM:</span></p><span></span><p><span>周末玩具 - 旅行团乐队</span></p><span></span><p><span>Barbie OST</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loc45EDX5KsWw8k_j37N6QIii4QQ.m4a" length="89401121" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:24:26</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFSEM2_D3naw1EBKno4wLTzNYum.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.12 颅内吵架 灵外漫游 尬聊乐夏3</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64e6cd7d3fa4090b741d27d3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64e6cd7d3fa4090b741d27d3</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 24 Aug 2023 03:24:45 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是芭乐人间指北。一档跨时区跨地区书影音文艺评论，交流，对话书影音文艺小指南（京城文艺小指南）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>经历了放开后的休整，和种种原因，最终决定重新开始录制芭乐人间指北，给各位忠实听众道歉！大家久等了！！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期我和我的嘉宾‘尬’聊了乐夏3的前两期，对乐夏3和乐队现状进行了尬评和期许。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Daisy：已经期待Livehouse三年啦我俗气本人，爱好音乐类型：朋克，Britpop，Alternative，Indie. 对电子毫无所知，对嘻哈甚至有些厌烦。主观评论。</span></p><span></span><p><span>齐先生：齐先生，东北人，一个用实践热爱音乐的人。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>关于录制本期主题的起承转合：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="169">02:49</a> 矮子里拔大个，看就看呗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 演出市场劣币驱逐良币，我们自主消费降级</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>回顾乐夏1/2的点点滴滴（演出、歌曲、乐队、导师、冲突）：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="595">09:55</a> 关于乐夏1还是2火的一些掰头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1183">19:43</a> 黛西：行为艺术everybody和周末玩具</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 齐先生：九五至尊（九连真人、五条人）的震撼教育</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>对比乐夏3：</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2180">36:20</a> 大乐迷：当前人都已不可说，坐在台底下的到底是谁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> 冲突：乐夏3甚至令我们怀念小乐！</span></p><span></span><p><span>阵容：请得来的请不来的基本都请来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3295">54:55</a>乐评人：经济不行咱们不能老做付费内容啊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>对乐夏3的期许：</span></p><span></span><p><span>大家多去livehouse，乐夏糊就让它别办了。</span></p>]]></description>
