  <item>
    <title>Vol.10 我们就没正经上过课 - 浅谈Britpop</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63eb6f44e99bdef7d3b37c13</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63eb6f44e99bdef7d3b37c13</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Feb 2023 11:23:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期内容通过我们高中特别的外教选修课经历，乱弹了一下Britpop, 是我们心中的英伦摇滚。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：黛西，初中朋克，高中英伦，上了一年西方音乐史选修课的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Hilary：现居北欧，Daisy的高中同学，音乐课小伙伴。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期最牛B的依然就是BGM啦，我们随聊随听！宇宙地表最牛的Britpop！</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目BGM彩蛋</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> Oasis，《Stand by me》：说起英伦，如果不放Oasis不合适吧！这就是相当于，开学歌，听着前奏你就知道，开学了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="218">03:38</a> Arctic Monkeys，《Do I Wanna Know》：那现在最红的英伦乐队带劲的就肯定是北极猴子啦。嘉宾的一些与外教相关记忆。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="494">08:14</a> Oasis，《Wonderwall》：英国外教灌输英国流行文化，那得放首第二国歌吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="752">12:32</a> Oasis，《Supersonic》：宇宙最diao绿洲乐队，英伦盘尼西林的态度！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1040">17:20</a> Oasis，《All Around the World》：这就是那张外教老师评价Rubbish的专辑Be Here Now的辣鸡歌曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1197">19:57</a> The Beatles，《Strawberry Fields Forever》：在选秀课被迷幻音乐吸引，带我走入了披头士的草莓园！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">21:44</a> The Beatles，《She Loves You》：英国60年代五月天，男欢女爱，嘉宾推荐。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a> The Beatles, 《Penny Lane》：随着我们的利物浦tour，一起走入penny lane。“利物浦不是我们的家！”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> Blur，《Country House》：NME十年大战，Blur终于赢了一回的歌曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1918">31:58</a> Oasis，《Don't Look Back in Anger》：绿洲乐队球迷歌曲，送给球迷们。顺道，曼城朴树张曼乐您也加油！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> John Lennon，《Happy Xmas（War Is Over）》：我的圣诞Routine，反战歌曲，送给大家！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2434">40:34</a> Craig Armstrong, 《PM's Love Theme》：Love Actually 插曲，总理那对的theme，非常英国。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2580">43:00</a> Hans Zimmer, 《Roadside Rhapsody》：The Holidays插曲，hans zimmer是我最爱的OST制作人，他做的OST那电影质量肯定也棒！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2714">45:14</a> Blur，《Girls&amp;Boys》：说起瑞典EDM，是时候放一放Blur的男男女女，顺便吐槽一下演唱会观众。这些男男女女。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> Radiohead ，《No Suprises》：嘉宾说，挺好听的Ok Computer的那首歌。还是放点我们都接受的歌吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3279">54:39</a> Radiohead，《High and Dry》：就the Bends吧，早期歌曲，属于嘉宾推荐歌曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3536">58:56</a> Radiohead，《Fake Plastic Trees》：私心还是放了典型英伦的the Bends。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3692">61:32</a> Coldplay，《Politik》：这就是2003悉尼演唱会，Chris Martin癫狂表演的第一首，令我入坑歌曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4055">67:35</a> Arctic Monkeys，《I Bet You Look Good on the Dancefloor》：猴子横空出世第一首歌啊！奥运会开幕式也表演啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4229">70:29</a> Arctic Monkeys，《No.1 Party Anthem》：说起AM这张宣传到美国的专辑，放首给大家听听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4475">74:35</a> Arctic Monkeys，《The Car》：油头猴子2022新专辑主打。特别红！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4547">75:47</a> Alex Turner，《Stuck on the Puzzle》：电影潜水艇插曲。丧b起床铃声。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4782">79:42</a> Coldplay，《Shiver》:我的私心推荐，高三陪伴我的Shiver，暗恋歌曲。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5076">84:36</a> Oasis，《Champagne Supernova》：这是我还没录好节目就想好的结尾曲。印象特别深的雨声，Someday you will find me in a Champagne Supernova in the sky。</span></p><span></span><p><span>谢谢大家！</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvaz6R5v5ECM-8Wrtwr5uG3N_27A.m4a" length="113746875" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:32:06</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuFSEM2_D3naw1EBKno4wLTzNYum.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>Vol.9 论文青与文盲之间绝望的再见：乱谈《再见爱人》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63e0b7d90d7e8eaa72075b12</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">63e0b7d90d7e8eaa72075b12</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 06 Feb 2023 08:18:33 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，这里是芭乐人间指北！一档跨时区跨地区书影音文艺小指南（京城文艺小指南）！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容乱谈了各位亲友们十分热衷，热度很高的年度综艺《再见爱人》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>主持人：黛西，一个语言上的巨人，行动上的矮子，理论专家，实践为0。本着八卦的心情看节目，悲观的底色看社会。</span></p><span></span><p><span>嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>萌萌：顶流萌总又来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>郭叔：顶流请来的男性视角，一个莫得感情和思想，争取把节目做黄的本期听众。</span></p><span></span><p><span>喵酱：喵酱老师听到要聊《再见爱人》又来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>玮玮：时差党玮玮带着已婚视角来了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期乱谈的脚本相对逻辑混乱，不如给大家一些配乐彩蛋，用欣赏BGM的视角欣赏一期乱弹。</span></p><span></span><blockquote><span>精彩段落：</span></blockquote><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="355">05:55</a> 《再见爱人》如何拉新，留存，促活跃，唤醒沉睡。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a> 节目的初印象：被美景吸引的诸位嘉宾。</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1140">19:00</a> 关于第二季各位嘉宾的评论</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5428">90:28</a> 关于第一季各位嘉宾的评论&nbsp;</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><blockquote><span>本期节目BGM彩蛋</span></blockquote><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> &nbsp;追星族乐队，《直到对的人来》：一响起前奏，就被郭柯宇带入她的情绪。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="468">07:48</a> 追星族乐队，《纯真年代》：是章鱼那部烂电影的插曲，郭柯宇确实是一个纯真的人儿。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 郭柯宇，《再见爱人》：主题曲，歌词就是新疆！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1170">19:30</a> 自游乐队，《爱像是昨天》：宋宁峰主演电影《青春期》主题曲，回到那昨天。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 尧十三，《他妈的》：说到文艺，想起那部电影推拿，般配，大俗治大雅。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 张玮玮，《米店》：宋宁峰跑上土坡给张婉婷拍夜间的塔，他将一身的文艺脱下，撑起那个家。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> &nbsp;魏如萱，《还是要相信爱情啊混蛋们》：讲完故事没有共鸣，大声疾呼，朋友们还是要相信爱情啊，混蛋们。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a> Marvin Gaye, 《What's going on》：这个后话真是令人黑人问号，敢问What's Going On?</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 岩井俊二，《Fish In The Pool》：说起文艺病，当然要放岩井俊二啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2737">45:37</a> 杨乃文，《放轻点》：卢歌，请你放轻点，争吵也不要许愿。我们的伤，有一天一定会好。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 魏如萱，《雪女》：苏诗丁，别人要的热情他只会要了我的命。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3240">54:00</a> 魏如萱，《歪》：从未彻底地满足，从未彻底的结束。渐行渐远，渐行渐歪。oh why？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3495">58:15</a> DarioMarianelli,Víkingur Ólafsson，《We Shall Fight》：苏&amp;卢，他们应该吵架，多吵架。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3950">65:50</a> 范宗沛,《意乱情迷》：大提琴就最适合TVB夫妇了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4170">69:30</a> 黎允文，《再会》：岁月神偷，那些岁月过后，谁来承担身后事。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4440">74:00</a> 范宗沛 ，《龙凤恋曲》：孽子里阿龙和阿凤剖开他的心脏，最后成为一生挚爱。爱的沉重是否包括生老病死。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4705">78:25</a> Fat Segal，《Skins Theme Tune》：我们都有上瘾的基因，无人来救，想到这个就想到英剧皮囊。那个overdosed年代。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4920">82:00</a> Tegan and Sara，《Where Does The Good Go》：来自美剧实习医生格蕾，一些dark and twisted，那些不良习惯还是需要问一问，where does the good go。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5135">85:35</a> Cat Power，《Hate》：暴力犯罪引来的争论。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5428">90:28</a> 追星族乐队&amp;郭柯宇，《纯真年代》：郭柯宇，一个纯粹而纯真的人。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5691">94:51</a> Brandi Carlile，《The Story》：来自实习医生格蕾，一把故事无人诉说，就是郭柯宇老师。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5940">99:00</a> Death Cab for Cutie，《Soul Meets Body》：来自美剧橘子郡男孩。郭珂精神上无法和章贺同频（quote from 喵酱），何时能待soul meets body。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6164">102:44</a> 鱼丁糸，《在世界的尽头大声地说我恨你》：老王的每句绝杀都另我们在世界尽头大声说我恨你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6412">106:52</a> Death Cab for Cutie，《A Lack Of Color》。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6642">110:42</a> Vanessa Carlton，《Afterglow》：世纪黄昏外套拥抱，献给最美的郭柯宇！bathed in afterglow！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6915">115:15</a> 魏如萱 ，《开始和结束之间》：为何冒险，为何不遮掩，人心 多完美的缺陷，爱 然后碎裂 复原</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7190">119:50</a> Cat Power，《TheGreatest》：Once I wanted to be the Greatest。My faith has been sleeping，lower me down，pin me in。老王的现实悲哀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7395">123:15</a> 宇多田光，《First Love》：来自日剧《First Love初恋》一些纯真的美好，节目组的美誉。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7655">127:35</a> 杨乃文，《你就是吃定我》：一些顾左右而言它的控诉，你就是吃定我如此爱你，才会把我的爱当作游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="7926">132:06</a> 追星族乐队，《蓝天》：郭柯宇老师的另一作品。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8127">135:27</a> 岩崎太整，《Blue Hour》：以下都是对日剧First love初恋的致敬。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8280">138:00</a> 岩崎太整 - Under the Same Sky Ⅰ</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8337">138:57</a> 岩崎太整 - Blue Hour (Reprise)</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="8560">142:40</a> 杨晨，《北方的冬》：来自我们初中最爱，网络调频。</span></p>]]></description>
